(*---
description: Checks mixed_safety_liveness on the two_cycles machine under weak fairness.
ref: tlc2/tool/liveness/LiveCheck.java; tlc2/tool/liveness/Liveness.java
features:
  - liveness
outcome: any
config: |
  SPECIFICATION Spec
  PROPERTY Prop
  CHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE
---*)
---- MODULE live_two_cycles__weak__mixed_safety_liveness ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLE x
Next == \/ x \in {0, 1} /\ x' = 1 - x
        \/ x = 1 /\ x' = 2
        \/ x = 2 /\ x' = 2
Spec == x = 0 /\ [][Next]_x /\ WF_x(Next)
Prop == [](x \in 0..2) /\ <>(x = 1) /\ [][x' >= 0]_x
====

